OL,3,GNEWSATop recognition for 'Britain's
OL,4,APompeii' collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA unique hoard of artefacts depicting
OL,7,Fprehistoric life has received one of
OL,8,Fthe highest honours available to
OL,9,Fmuseums in England.
OL,11,FThe Peterborough Museum and Art
OL,12,FGallery's prehistoric exhibits were
OL,13,Famong nine collections recently awarded
OL,14,Fdesignated status by Arts Council
OL,15,FEngland.
OL,17,FThe collection spans thousands of
OL,18,Fyears, including tools and artefacts,
OL,19,Fsuch as Bronze Age log boats and finds
OL,20,Ffrom Must Farm near Whittlesey - the
OL,21,Fsettlement often compared with Pompeii.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
