OL,4,APompeii' collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Wilson, a heritage manager at
OL,7,FPeterborough Museum and Art Gallery,
OL,8,Fcalled it a "landmark moment" for the
OL,9,Fmuseum and the city.
